hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1741","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab ye aayat naazil hui: (Kaho: Wo qaadir hai ke tum par tumharey upar se azaab bhejey). To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main terey chehrey ki panaah maangta hun. Unhon-ne kaha: (Ya tumhaarey pairon key neechey se). Aap ne farmaya: Main terey chehrey ki panaah maangta hun. (Ya tumhey girohon mein milaaey aur tum mein se baaz ko baaz ki ladai chakhaaey). Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye halka hai. Ya ye aasaan hai. (Bukhari: 4628). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Wo jinhey Allah ne hidaayat di, to unki hidaayat ki pairwi karo)."
"1742","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya (Saad) mein sajda hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Phir unhon-ne tilaawat ki: (Aur ham ne use Ishaaq aur Yaqoob ata kiye) uskey qaul (to unki hidaayat ki pairwi karo) tak. Phir unhon-ne kaha: Tumhaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un mein se hain jinhey unki pairwi ka hukm diya gaya tha. (Bukhari: 4632). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur be-hayaaiyon key qareeb na jao jo un mein zaahir hain aur jo chhupi huin hain)."
"1743","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur Aap ne marfooan farmaya: Allah se zyada ghairat wala koi nahi hai, isliye us ne be-hayaaiyon ko haraam kya jo un mein zaahir hain aur jo chhupi huin hain. Aur Allah se tareef ko koi zyada pasand nahi karta, isliye us ne apne aap ki tareef ki. (Bukhari: 4634). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Maafi ko pakdo aur achhai ka hukm do) aayat."
